  "description": {
   "en": "Millennia-old Chinese clothing culture intertwines the fantastical lives of two girls.\n\nOne day, Bai Tang, a freshman in university, accidentally \"picked up\" a girl named Zhu Lian, a quirky girl dressed in Tang dynasty attire who valiantly claimed to be from over one thousand years ago... From that moment on, Bai Tang's ordinary life takes a wild turn."
